    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我的妈妈是一名学生，她在大学学习日语。她很忙。",
      "traditional": "我的媽媽是一名學生，她在大學學習日語。她很忙。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de mā ma shì yì míng xué sheng tā zài dà xué xué xí rì yǔ tā hěn máng",
      "english": "My mom is a student. She studies Japanese at university. She is very busy."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "星期一、星期二、星期四、星期五，上午八点，妈妈去学校学习；",
      "traditional": "星期一、星期二、星期四、星期五，上午八點，媽媽去學校學習；",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī yī xīng qī èr xīng qī sì xīng qī wǔ shàng wǔ bā diǎn mā ma qù xué xiào xué xí",
      "english": "On Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday at 8 in the morning mom goes to school to study."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "下午五点，妈妈在家吃饭；下午六点半，妈妈去工作；",
      "traditional": "下午五點，媽媽在家吃飯；下午六點半，媽媽去工作；",
      "pinyin": "xià wǔ wǔ diǎn mā ma zài jiā chī fàn xià wǔ liù diǎn bàn mā ma qù gōng zuò",
      "english": "At 5 in the afternoon, mom eats dinner at home. At 6:30 in the afternoon, mom goes to work."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "晚上十二点，妈妈睡觉。",
      "traditional": "晚上十二點，媽媽睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "wǎn shang shí èr diǎn mā ma shuì jiào",
      "english": "At midnight, mom goes to sleep."
    },
    {
