      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "星期三，妈妈不去学校。",
      "traditional": "星期三，媽媽不去學校。",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī sān mā ma bú qù xué xiào",
      "english": "On Wednesday, mom doesn’t go to school."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "她上午在家看书，去商店买菜，下午去工作。",
      "traditional": "她上午在家看書，去商店買菜，下午去工作。",
      "pinyin": "tā shàng wǔ zài jiā kàn shū qù shāng diàn mǎi cài xià wǔ qù gōng zuò",
      "english": "In the morning, she studies at home and goes to the store to buy groceries. In the afternoon, she goes to work."
    },
    {
