    "sentence_translations": [
      "Mom Loves Making Phone Calls",
      "",
      "My mom is a student. She studies Japanese at university. She is very busy.",
      "",
      "On Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday at 8 in the morning mom goes to school to study.",
      "At 5 in the afternoon, mom eats dinner at home. At 6:30 in the afternoon, mom goes to work.",
      "At midnight, mom goes to sleep.",
      "",
      "On Wednesday, mom doesn’t go to school.",
      "In the morning, she studies at home and goes to the store to buy groceries. In the afternoon, she goes to work.",
      "",
      "On Saturday and Sunday, mom doesn’t go to school.",
      "In the morning, she studies at home and makes phone calls. In the afternoon, she goes to work.",
      "",
      "My mom really loves making phone calls.",
      "On Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, and Sunday she makes phone calls.",
      "She has a thing that she calls a computer.",
      "She really loves speaking with the computer. Inside the computer, there is also a person who speaks.",
      "",
      "Look! Mom is making a phone call. Mom is talking. Mom is smiling. Mom is truly beautiful!",
